                            {countries.map(c => <option key={c.code} value={c.code}>{c.flag} {c.name}</option>)}
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label className="block text-sm font-medium mb-1">Sektör Seçimi</label>
                        <select 
                            className="w-full p-2 border rounded focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 outline-none"
                            value={selectedSector}
                            onChange={(e) => setSelectedSector(e.target.value as SectorName)}
                        >
                            {Object.keys(sectorWeights).map(s => <option key={s} value={s}>{s}</option>)}
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                    {/* SRF Inputs */}
                    <div>
                        <h4 className="font-bold text-gray-700 mb-3 border-b pb-2 flex justify-between">
                            <span>SRF: Sektörel Risk Yönetimi</span>
                            <span className="text-sm bg-gray-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-gray-600">%35</span>
                        </h4>
                        <p className="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-4">Puan ne kadar yüksekse, risk yönetimi o kadar güçlüdür.</p>
                        {Object.entries(srfInputs).map(([key, val]) => (
                            <div key={key} className="mb-3">
                                <div className="flex justify-between text-sm mb-1">
                                    <span>{key} (Ağırlık: %{(activeWeights as any)[key] * 100})</span>
                                    <span className="font-bold">{val}</span>
                                </div>
                                <input type="range" min="0" max="100" value={val} onChange={(e) => handleSrfChange(key, e.target.value)} className="w-full h-1.5 bg-gray-200 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-blue-600" />
                            </div>
                        ))}
                    </div>

                    {/* KNA Inputs */}
                    <div>
                         <h4 className="font-bold text-gray-700 mb-3 border-b pb-2 flex justify-between">
                            <span>KNA: Kör Nokta Farkındalığı</span>
                            <span className="text-sm bg-gray-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-gray-600">%25</span>
                        </h4>
                        <p className="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-4">Puan ne kadar yüksekse, kör noktalar o kadar azdır (farkındalık yüksek).</p>
                        <div className="mb-3">
                            <div className="flex justify-between text-sm mb-1"><span>OKN: Organizasyonel (%30)</span><span className="font-bold">{knaInputs.OKN}</span></div>
                            <input type="range" min="0" max="100" value={knaInputs.OKN} onChange={(e) => handleKnaChange('OKN', e.target.value)} className="w-full h-1.5 bg-gray-200 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-green-600" />
                        </div>
                        <div className="mb-3">
                            <div className="flex justify-between text-sm mb-1"><span>SKN: Sektörel (%25)</span><span className="font-bold">{knaInputs.SKN}</span></div>
                            <input type="range" min="0" max="100" value={knaInputs.SKN} onChange={(e) => handleKnaChange('SKN', e.target.value)} className="w-full h-1.5 bg-gray-200 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-green-600" />
                        </div>
                        <div className="mb-3">
                            <div className="flex justify-between text-sm mb-1"><span>TKN: Teknolojik (%25)</span><span className="font-bold">{knaInputs.TKN}</span></div>
                            <input type="range" min="0" max="100" value={knaInputs.TKN} onChange={(e) => handleKnaChange('TKN', e.target.value)} className="w-full h-1.5 bg-gray-200 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-green-600" />
                        </div>
                         <div className="mb-3">
                            <div className="flex justify-between text-sm mb-1"><span>KKN: Kültürel (%20)</span><span className="font-bold">{knaInputs.KKN}</span></div>
                            <input type="range" min="0" max="100" value={knaInputs.KKN} onChange={(e) => handleKnaChange('KKN', e.target.value)} className="w-full h-1.5 bg-gray-200 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-green-600" />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div className="lg:col-span-4 space-y-6">
            {/* Main Score Card with Dynamic Theme */}
            <div className={`${quadrantInfo.bgGradient} text-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center relative overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ring-1 ring-white/10`}>
                <div className="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10">
                    <ShieldCheck size={120} />
                </div>
                <h3 className="text-xl font-bold mb-2 z-10 text-white/90">SEGRİ-SRKA Skoru</h3>
                <div className={`text-6xl font-black mb-2 z-10 ${quadrantInfo.accentColor} drop-shadow-md`}>{srkaResult.toFixed(1)}</div>
                <div className="text-sm opacity-80 mb-6 z-10 font-medium">Genişletilmiş Risk Çerçevesi</div>

                <div className={`w-full p-4 rounded-xl mb-4 border-2 bg-black/20 backdrop-blur-sm ${quadrantInfo.borderColor}`}>
                    <div className="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-1">
                        {quadrantInfo.icon}
                        <h4 className="text-lg font-black uppercase tracking-wide">{quadrantInfo.name}</h4>
                    </div>
                    <p className={`text-xs font-semibold ${quadrantInfo.textColor} opacity-90`}>{quadrantInfo.desc}</p>
                    <p className="text-xs mt-3 italic bg-white/10 p-2.5 rounded-lg text-white border border-white/10">
                        "{quadrantInfo.strategy}"
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div className="text-xs text-left w-full space-y-1.5 opacity-90 bg-black/20 p-3 rounded-lg border border-white/5">
                    <div className="flex justify-between"><span>SEGRİ (Girişimcilik):</span> <span className="font-bold text-white">{activeCountry.SEGRI.toFixed(1)}</span></div>
                    <div className="flex justify-between"><span>SRF (Risk Ynt.):</span> <span className="font-bold text-blue-200">{srfScore.toFixed(1)}</span></div>
                    <div className="flex justify-between"><span>KNA (Farkındalık):</span> <span className="font-bold text-green-200">{knaScore.toFixed(1)}</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            {/* Matrix Visualization & Strategy Guide */}
            <div className="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
                <div className="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 border-b pb-2">
                    <Info size={16} className="text-gray-400" />
                    <h4 className="font-bold text-gray-800 text-sm">Stratejik Konumlandırma Rehberi</h4>
                </div>

                {/* Visual Grid */}
                <div className="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs mb-5">
                     {/* Opportunist: High SEGRİ, Low Risk */}
                    <div className={`p-2 rounded border text-center transition-all ${quadrantInfo.id === 'opportunist' ? 'bg-blue-100 border-blue-500 ring-2 ring-blue-500/20 shadow-md opacity-100 scale-105 z-10' : 'bg-gray-50 border-gray-200 opacity-50 grayscale'}`}>
                        <div className="font-black text-blue-800 mb-0.5">FIRSATÇI</div>
                        <div className="text-[9px] text-blue-600 leading-tight">Yüksek SEGRİ<br/>Düşük Risk Ynt.</div>
                    </div>
                    {/* Leader: High SEGRİ, High Risk */}
                    <div className={`p-2 rounded border text-center transition-all ${quadrantInfo.id === 'leader' ? 'bg-green-100 border-green-500 ring-2 ring-green-500/20 shadow-md opacity-100 scale-105 z-10' : 'bg-gray-50 border-gray-200 opacity-50 grayscale'}`}>
                        <div className="font-black text-green-800 mb-0.5">LİDER</div>
                        <div className="text-[9px] text-green-600 leading-tight">Yüksek SEGRİ<br/>Yüksek Risk Ynt.</div>
                    </div>
                    {/* Risky: Low SEGRİ, Low Risk */}
                    <div className={`p-2 rounded border text-center transition-all ${quadrantInfo.id === 'risky' ? 'bg-red-100 border-red-500 ring-2 ring-red-500/20 shadow-md opacity-100 scale-105 z-10' : 'bg-gray-50 border-gray-200 opacity-50 grayscale'}`}>
                        <div className="font-black text-red-800 mb-0.5">RİSKLİ</div>
                        <div className="text-[9px] text-red-600 leading-tight">Düşük SEGRİ<br/>Düşük Risk Ynt.</div>
                    </div>
                    {/* Protector: Low SEGRİ, High Risk */}
                    <div className={`p-2 rounded border text-center transition-all ${quadrantInfo.id === 'protector' ? 'bg-purple-100 border-purple-500 ring-2 ring-purple-500/20 shadow-md opacity-100 scale-105 z-10' : 'bg-gray-50 border-gray-200 opacity-50 grayscale'}`}>
                        <div className="font-black text-purple-800 mb-0.5">KORUYUCU</div>
                        <div className="text-[9px] text-purple-600 leading-tight">Düşük SEGRİ<br/>Yüksek Risk Ynt.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                {/* Detailed Strategy Explanations */}
                <div className="space-y-2 text-xs">
                    <div className={`p-2.5 rounded-lg border-l-4 transition-all ${quadrantInfo.id === 'leader' ? 'bg-green-50 border-green-500 shadow-sm' : 'border-transparent text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-50'}`}>
                        <span className="font-bold text-gray-900 block mb-0.5">Lider Dayanıklı (Yeşil)</span>
                        <span>Hem girişimcilik kasları hem de risk yönetimi güçlüdür. Strateji: <span className="italic font-medium">Mevcut konumu koru ve global dominasyon sağla.</span></span>
                    </div>
                    <div className={`p-2.5 rounded-lg border-l-4 transition-all ${quadrantInfo.id === 'opportunist' ? 'bg-blue-50 border-blue-500 shadow-sm' : 'border-transparent text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-50'}`}>
                        <span className="font-bold text-gray-900 block mb-0.5">Fırsatçı Büyümeci (Mavi)</span>
                        <span>Hızlı büyüyen ama kırılgan yapı. Strateji: <span className="italic font-medium">Büyümeyi kesmeden kurumsal risk altyapısını inşa et.</span></span>
                    </div>
                    <div className={`p-2.5 rounded-lg border-l-4 transition-all ${quadrantInfo.id === 'protector' ? 'bg-purple-50 border-purple-500 shadow-sm' : 'border-transparent text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-50'}`}>
                        <span className="font-bold text-gray-900 block mb-0.5">Koruyucu Dayanıklı (Mor)</span>
                        <span>Güçlü defans ama düşük inovasyon. Strateji: <span className="italic font-medium">Risk toleransını kontrollü şekilde artırarak inovasyonu teşvik et.</span></span>
                    </div>
                    <div className={`p-2.5 rounded-lg border-l-4 transition-all ${quadrantInfo.id === 'risky' ? 'bg-red-50 border-red-500 shadow-sm' : 'border-transparent text-gray-400 hover:bg-gray-50'}`}>
                        <span className="font-bold text-gray-900 block mb-0.5">Riskli Kırılgan (Kırmızı)</span>
                        <span>Her iki eksende de zayıf performans. Strateji: <span className="italic font-medium">Acil kriz yönetimi ve köklü yapısal dönüşüm.</span></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
  );
};

